WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:20.320
I — have worn too many names.

2
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:26.180
Tried to find the one that fits.

3
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:36.060
Identified myself by what I've done.

4
00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.100
Cared what the world thinks.

5
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:51.340
Afraid to come up empty.

6
00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:59.440
Afraid to leave no mark.

7
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:07.560
Traded everything I was.

8
00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:14.860
Trying to find out who I am.

9
00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:24.900
But in the garden in the dark.

10
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:31.360
He — didn't come to teach or speak.

11
00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:41.320
Christ — measured the full weight of me.

12
00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:47.060
Every sorrow, every dream.

13
00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:56.600
Every shame I've carried quietly.

14
00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:03.140
Every hope I couldn't name.

15
00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:13.400
He felt it all from the inside.

16
00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:19.760
And — He didn't turn away.

17
00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:33.760
You always knew me.

18
00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:38.640
Before I knew myself.

19
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:49.600
You didn't wait for me to find you.

20
00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:59.740
You came to know me first, earn my trust.

21
00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:04.480
I am a child of God.

22
00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:08.520
That's who I've always been.

23
00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:13.640
I don't have to search anymore.

24
00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:21.880
I'm already known.

25
00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:31.720
I'm already loved.

26
00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:40.280
I've found my heavenly home.

27
00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:51.360
He — didn't stay dead, He lives

28
00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:56.420
That's the thing that makes it real.

29
00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:06.420
He — rose and works among the faithful still.

30
00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.620
Not a memory.

31
00:04:10.120 --> 00:04:14.920
Not just an ideal.

32
00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:21.220
All that time I spent on fear.

33
00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:25.270
All that searching, all that weight.

34
00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:31.090
Now I set it free — and I'll use it well.

35
00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:39.440
On something worth my days.

36
00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:45.200
Not just a teacher.

37
00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.800
Not just a death.

38
00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.760
He used the power of Creation.

39
00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:57.080
To know me first.

40
00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.560
And knowing me completely.

41
00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:04.820
He thought I was worth His life.

42
00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:10.420
He thought you were worth it, too.

43
00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:17.400
He still does.

44
00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:29.420
You always knew me.

45
00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.960
Before I knew myself.

46
00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:47.420
You didn't wait for me to find you.

47
00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:57.480
You came to know me first, earn my trust.

48
00:05:58.060 --> 00:06:08.280
I am a child of God, and so are you.

49
00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:13.520
You don't have to search anymore.

50
00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:20.380
You're already known.

51
00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:28.020
You're already loved.

52
00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:41.580
Welcome home...

53
00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:52.460
The search is over it was always over.

54
00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:58.040
He just wanted you to know.

55
00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:07.260
In the name of Jesus Christ.

56
00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.780
Amen.
